WEBVTT

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:08.150
Right now, we're in southwest
Gaun, in the Crest Forest.

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:12.330
We've rushed here as fast as we could to
get to an elf village located in this forest.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:14.660
It's strange...

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:17.800
like I've been here before.

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:21.250
You're a half-elf, after all.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:23.590
It might be your elf blood
making you think that.

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:25.980
You think so?

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:27.840
That's strange, though.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.160
I was taught that elves only
lived on the Western Continent,

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:33.080
and that you couldn't find them here,
on the Eastern Continent.

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:40.270
Over a decade ago, some elves moved
from the Western Continent to here.

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:43.850
Now they seem to be under Gaun's protection.

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:49.610
As for why we're heading
to an elven village...

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:52.390
Those assassins from Trycen...

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:57.900
Until now, Trycen's been insisting they
had nothing to do with the Black Wind,

00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.860
and are trying their best
to keep things quiet.

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:02.940
And now they're attacking you, huh?

00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:09.330
Actually, every country on the
continent has been seeing activity

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:12.640
on their borders with Trycen.

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:14.100
Which means?

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:20.210
There've been small-scale skirmishes between
Trycen and its neighboring country of Gaun.

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:23.560
But nothing major.

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:26.800
They've been especially reluctant
to try anything with Parth,

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:30.940
a symbol of peace on the continent,
or Toraj, an important agricultural center.

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:31.970
And now...

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:35.270
Force recon. Acquiring slaves.

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:40.810
Something may have changed in the
political situation in Trycen.

00:01:40.810 --> 00:01:45.380
There's a chance they'll attempt
an invasion somewhere.

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:48.320
War, you mean?

00:01:48.510 --> 00:01:52.350
That's simply my personal
opinion, of course.

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:55.210
But be careful.

00:01:55.210 --> 00:02:00.560
If what your attackers said is true,
odds are Trycen will come for you again.

00:02:01.860 --> 00:02:03.460
Oh, that's right.

00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:06.690
I had a job for you.

00:02:07.570 --> 00:02:10.370
A special job directly from the Guildmaster?

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:11.560
Or...

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:20.650
It's from Leonhart Gaun,
the Beast King of Gaun.

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:25.920
He'll be meeting you personally.

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:31.570
Good luck with your Rank S promotion exam.

00:02:32.030 --> 00:02:38.550
A Rank S promotion exam, offered by a King!

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:40.420
You're amazing, Brother Kel!

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:45.550
One of the conditions for becoming a Rank S adventurer is the approval of a ruler, right?

00:02:45.550 --> 00:02:47.860
Yeah. I need at least two, actually.

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:52.970
Leo spoke to Queen Tsubaki
from Toraj, and she agreed.

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:57.970
And it sounds like King Leonhart
heard all the bragging she did.

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:02.110
What's King Leonhart like?

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:04.010
As is customary in his nation,

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:06.950
he left on a journey in his
teens to learn to fight.

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:09.880
He ended up a Rank S adventurer.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:12.300
He sounds strong, right?

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:16.570
My King, you're not getting
any ideas, are you?

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:20.400
No... I'm definitely not thinking about
how much fun it would be to fight him,

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.160
or to kick his ass!

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:29.430
But if he's that strong, he could just
do whatever this job is himself.

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:36.190
Protect an elven village from an unknown
Rank S monster that came out of nowhere, huh?

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:42.440
From what we've seen so far, there's a
99% chance Trycen's somehow involved.

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:44.660
Well, no need to hold back!

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:46.430
We're going to give it our all!

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:47.050
Yeah!

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:48.420
Understood.

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:50.610
That's just like you, My Lord!

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:53.090
But you can't let your guard down...

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:57.800
Yup. We might get attacked out of nowhere!

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:02.630
Those are...

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:04.930
elves!

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:10.660
I have come at the order
of King Leonhart of Gaun!

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:13.280
I am Kelvin, the adventurer!

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:15.090
Please, listen to me!

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:16.880
King Leonhart?

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:18.290
Really?

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:21.090
That letter looks real...

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:27.760
Kelvin the Adventurer...

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:31.430
I apologize for our ignorance.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:36.630
I am Nelras, the elder of the elf village.

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:38.680
He's the elder?

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:40.430
He looks so young.

00:04:40.430 --> 00:04:41.830
Well, he is an elf.

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:45.280
King Leonhart has told me all about you.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:49.050
Thank you for coming all this way...

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:55.510
Lumil? How are you alive...?

00:04:57.010 --> 00:04:57.990
Lumil?

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:12.120
Black Summoner

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:45.660
I'm so sorry about what
happened back there, Kelvin.

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:51.080
Before we discuss King Leonhart's request,
can we talk about something else?

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:56.090
You mean how I mistook Efil
there for Lumil, yes?

00:06:56.740 --> 00:06:57.730
Yes.

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:00.290
She's a member of our party now,

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:03.400
but before that, she was afflicted
with the Fire Dragon King's curse,

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:06.320
and had been a slave for as
long as she could remember.

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:07.820
How awful...

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:11.320
Please, tell us about Lumil.

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:15.370
She may be a clue to where Efil came from.

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:21.210
Very well.

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:24.370
It was 20 years ago, or so...

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:30.700
We lived in peace, deep in a
forest on the Western Continent.

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:35.070
And then one day, we were attacked
by the Fire Dragon King,

00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:37.690
one of the kings of the great dragons.

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:43.170
He demanded we offer up the
elf who had humiliated him,

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:47.650
or he would burn our village to ash.

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:51.620
I still don't know what had angered him so,

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:55.870
since we'd had barely any
contact with him prior.

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:59.170
But his wrath was terrible,

00:07:59.170 --> 00:08:04.480
and over half the village died
without even knowing the reason.

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:07.380
My leg was injured then, too.

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:12.420
But one of our number rose up.

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:15.640
That was Lumil.

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:18.220
Lumil...

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:23.510
She stood before the
Fire Dragon King and said,

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:27.870
"Please, turn your wrath towards me,

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:31.910
and spare the others."

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:34.840
And the Fire Dragon King said,

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:37.610
"You are not the elf I seek.

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:44.780
But if you will be my bride, I shall
forget the insult I suffered."

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:48.440
Lumil agreed, and...

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:54.840
The Fire Dragon King took her away.

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:58.810
She's so courageous!

00:08:58.810 --> 00:09:02.610
Yes. She was strong, and kind.

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:07.390
But if the Fire Dragon King left,
then the threat was gone.

00:09:07.390 --> 00:09:11.480
And yet you fled the Western Continent...

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:13.100
Correct.

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:20.870
You see, years later, Lumil's body
was found in the forest.

00:09:22.090 --> 00:09:24.520
We don't know what happened.

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:30.920
But with Lumil dead, we feared
the Fire Dragon King's return,

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:36.810
and fled the Western
Continent for this land.

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:39.730
If you look so similar that
Nelras mistook you for her,

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:43.260
does that mean Lumil is your mother?

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:47.230
Then perhaps Efil is Lumil and
the Fire Dragon King's...

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:49.220
No, that's impossible.

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:53.930
Half-elves are always born
of a human and an elf.

00:09:53.930 --> 00:09:56.210
A dragon's blood would be too strong.

00:09:56.530 --> 00:10:01.520
But it's still possible
that Lumil's her mother.

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:04.120
I'm sorry, Efil.

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:06.580
I don't know anything else...

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:10.120
No, thank you, Nelras.

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:14.790
I have no memories of my mother or father.

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:16.580
They've been gone for as
long as I can remember.

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:20.920
But no matter what happened
in my past, I'm fine.

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:25.310
I've got my comrades, and my master.

00:10:25.670 --> 00:10:28.030
I'm with a family that I love!

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:32.470
It seems you've met comrades
you can trust, then.

00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:33.640
Yes!

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:35.820
Efil!

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:36.460
S-Sera?

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:39.430
I'm here for you too, okay, Sister Efil?

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:41.870
We'll never leave you!

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:43.070
You have very lively friends.

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:43.490
I'm here for you, too!

00:10:43.070 --> 00:10:43.900
Yeah.

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:44.990
Thank you!

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:47.880
Now, let's get to the main subject.

00:10:48.130 --> 00:10:48.950
Yes.

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:54.670
King Leonhart had said that a new type
of monster, along with its servants,

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:57.310
has been kidnapping elves.

00:10:57.310 --> 00:10:58.120
Yes.

00:10:58.510 --> 00:11:04.260
We have a powerful barrier in the forest
that disrupts one's sense of direction.

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:09.020
But the monsters seemed to know
exactly where the village was.

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:13.260
There are skills that can
nullify barriers, after all.

00:11:13.260 --> 00:11:15.730
We made it past the thing, for instance.

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:18.590
It's come two or three times.

00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:25.740
It looked less like an all-out attack,
and more like an attempt to kidnap us elves.

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:29.000
Monsters don't usually have
that level of organization.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:31.390
Of course, we fought back.

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:34.020
But we weren't strong enough...

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:38.460
And the soldiers from Gaun failed, too...

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:40.850
Elder, don't worry!

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:43.010
We're here to stop that!

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:46.180
Yes, we'll protect you!

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:47.590
I'll do my best, too!

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:51.440
Yes, I'll help in any way I can.

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:52.080
Of course.

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:56.020
Thank you so much, everyone...

00:11:56.020 --> 00:12:01.790
Actually, Elder, I'd like permission
to renovate this village a little.

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:03.020
"Renovate" it?

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:06.010
Yes. If you'll give me permission,

00:12:06.010 --> 00:12:11.040
I can promise the monsters won't
be able to lay a finger on you.

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:16.260
Very well. I'll let you do
what you feel you must.

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:17.670
Thank you!

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:21.120
It's gotta be more than a simple trap.

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:23.790
I feel some sympathy for our foes.

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:28.720
Time to get busy...

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:34.980
Name: Efil
Level: 93 Title: Perfect Maid
HP 744/744
MP 1415/1415
Age: 16 | Strength 375
Race: Half-elf | Endurance 372
Sex: Female | Agility 1424
Class: Armed Maid | Magic 918
Luck 187
Skills:
Archery (S) | Red Magic (A) | Far Seeing (B)
Stealth (A) | Service (A) | Cooking (S) Sewing (S) Ultra-Agile (S)
Boost Magic (B) | Double Growth Rate | Double Skill Points
Assist Effects:
Fire Dragon King's Curse | Concealment (S)

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:34.980
Black Summoner

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:45.770
Don't stop. Keep going.

00:12:48.770 --> 00:12:53.030
Commander, it looks like the Gaun
cowards are nowhere to be found.

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:57.580
They probably got scared of
the Mixed Demon Beast Army.

00:12:58.150 --> 00:13:01.250
We're making an awful lot of noise.

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:03.590
I'm sure they noticed, but...

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:09.200
They're cowards! Watch out for ambushes!

00:13:10.820 --> 00:13:16.280
We give Gaun plenty of information, and then
take out whoever they send to stop us.

00:13:16.630 --> 00:13:21.540
General Tristan's plan is ready
for its most important stage!

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:26.760
Where do you suppose General Tristan
got that collar, though?

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:30.950
It's a special type that works
even on S Ranks, they say!

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:35.960
The rumors say he got it from a merchant
that's been visiting the castle lately.

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:40.200
With this kind of firepower, even the
Beast King and his men themselves couldn't...

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:42.710
What happened?

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:46.330
I don't know! He just... collapsed!

00:13:47.710 --> 00:13:49.080
What's going on?

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:51.510
He was hit by something
that looked like an arrow!

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:55.510
That's impossible!
I didn't hear anything at all!

00:13:55.510 --> 00:13:58.650
And the elf village is a long ways away!

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.810
But he just got hit by something—

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:03.480
Enemy attack! Enemy attack!

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:09.100
Protect yourselves with the monster!

00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:11.570
They're using some kind of invisible attack!

00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:14.110
Impossible!

00:14:14.440 --> 00:14:17.120
What's going on here?!

00:14:17.950 --> 00:14:21.390
Next, hit the one hiding behind the troll.

00:14:21.390 --> 00:14:25.140
Yeah, leave the one that looks
like he's higher-ranked till later.

00:14:25.470 --> 00:14:27.410
We'll catch him and interrogate him.

00:14:27.410 --> 00:14:28.830
Got it!

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:33.510
Okay, hit.

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:35.650
Looks like the bow's working well.

00:14:35.650 --> 00:14:40.690
Yes. This Shadow Bow Merciless you made for me

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:45.900
Shadow Bow Merciless (Rank S)

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:45.900
Empowering the bow with magic creates arrows
that can be fired without making a sound.
Arrows that hit will disappear.

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:43.490
can reach anywhere as
long as I put magic into it.

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:45.890
It makes no noise, either!

00:14:46.430 --> 00:14:50.570
I built this watchtower
with Adamantine Rampart.

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:59.310
And Mel's blue magic spell False Fog makes it
invisible outside the walls of the elf village.

00:14:59.980 --> 00:15:02.910
I've also made those walls
massively stronger.

00:15:03.520 --> 00:15:07.760
And the water in the moats is now
enhanced by Sera's black magic.

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:13.080
Even if the enemy gets close,
they won't make it inside.

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:18.580
I'm remaining on defense this time, right?

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:20.690
Have fun, everyone.

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:21.990
Roger!

00:15:21.990 --> 00:15:24.950
You won't have anything
to do, so go take a nap.

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:27.120
Sera, don't go too hard, okay?

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:29.500
Yup! Sister Mel is right!

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:32.620
We're capturing the
important-looking person, right?

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:34.160
If we can.

00:15:34.630 --> 00:15:37.750
Our main goal is to protect the village.

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:40.610
Don't do anything that would cause too
much damage to the forest, either.

00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:43.960
Okay, let's get started!

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:50.920
Vice-Commander!

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:53.050
Huge trouble!

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:56.420
Calm down! What's happened?

00:15:56.420 --> 00:16:00.130
We almost made it to the elf village when
we were attacked by an unknown enemy!

00:16:00.130 --> 00:16:05.160
Unit 4 was wiped out and the
Battalion Commander taken!

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:07.180
They aren't Gaun soldiers!

00:16:07.180 --> 00:16:12.540
What? If they're not Gaun, then where
are they from? Toraj? Deramis?

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:16.330
They're not soldiers.
They appear to be an adventuring party.

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:17.620
What?!

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:19.710
We don't know who they are,

00:16:19.710 --> 00:16:23.540
but we've confirmed three
women and one Shadow Wolf!

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:27.660
They're all incredibly powerful,
and Rank B monsters can't stop them!

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:30.290
We cannot continue the advance!

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:31.620
What?

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:37.600
Unit 5 is engaging them now, but it won't
be long before they reach our camp!

00:16:40.630 --> 00:16:42.950
We'll have to use our secret weapon, then.

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:46.190
It will be our main tactic
we use to defeat the enemy.

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:48.430
Are you listening?

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:50.730
Vice-Commander!

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:54.190
Oh, there he is!

00:16:54.420 --> 00:16:57.420
That's the enemy commander,
right, Sister Mel?

00:16:57.420 --> 00:16:59.950
Thank you for guiding us here.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:03.090
Thanks to you, we didn't get lost.

00:17:03.090 --> 00:17:05.010
Don't tell me that they're...

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:07.260
Hey!

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:11.340
Wake up, Gigant Lord!

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:13.420
We need you!

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:26.820
Don't let your guard down for a second!

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:30.930
Look at that! That giant's gigantic!

00:17:30.930 --> 00:17:32.140
Like it's out of a manga!

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:38.490
Rion, you and Alex go defeat it.

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:41.170
Just the two of us?

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:47.210
Yes. If you can do it, that means
you're a full-fledged adventurer.

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:50.570
It's probably equivalent to a Rank S monster.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:52.450
Can you handle it?

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:04.140
Grandpa Gerard and Brother Kel
have been teaching me swordsmanship

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:07.460
and magic from dawn to dusk every day.

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:09.240
I can do it!

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:13.100
I can't be the little sister
that everyone protects forever!

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:15.730
I want to protect everyone myself!

00:18:15.730 --> 00:18:17.940
We can do it, right, Alex?

00:18:21.260 --> 00:18:22.220
Okay!

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:25.770
You'll be fine.

00:18:25.770 --> 00:18:29.680
If you can use your full power,
I'm sure you'll be fine.

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:31.940
She went alone!

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:33.460
They underestimate us!

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:34.710
Gigant Lord!

00:18:40.600 --> 00:18:42.590
Let's go, Alex!

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:54.640
Hah! That worthless blade
can't hurt a Rank S!

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:57.610
Then...

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:04.620
That's what you get!

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:05.750
Got her!

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:12.510
This isn't good...

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:14.930
If it gets one clean hit on me,
I'm as good as dead.

00:19:15.390 --> 00:19:16.400
But...

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:22.130
If you can do it, that means you're
a full-fledged adventurer.

00:19:24.900 --> 00:19:28.270
Clotho, back me up! You, too, Alex!

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:33.360
Time to get serious, Mr. Giant!

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:39.110
Dual Wielding? Only a hero can use that!

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:43.340
Really? It was on my skill list with
the other stuff, so I didn't know!

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:52.720
Brother Kel made me the Magic Sword
Caladbolg and the False Holy Sword Wil.

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:55.660
And for Alex, the Raging Blade Lethal!

00:19:56.070 --> 00:19:58.240
We don't use two swords.

00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:00.730
Wolf and girl, together we use three!

00:20:01.210 --> 00:20:03.180
Generate Edge!

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:08.210
Impossible!

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:10.720
A little kid slew our giant?

00:20:10.720 --> 00:20:11.950
We did it!

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:13.870
Gigant Lord!

00:20:13.870 --> 00:20:15.890
Transform! Now!

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:27.860
Oh, so that's its true form.

00:20:27.860 --> 00:20:31.700
Lucky. I want to fight it, too!

00:20:32.060 --> 00:20:33.900
Master...

00:20:33.900 --> 00:20:36.240
Rion will be fine.

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:38.010
Yeah.

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:41.830
Go, Gigant Furnace!

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:46.430
Burn her with purgatorial flames!

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:51.370
Well, it doesn't actually change anything.

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:52.150
Because...

00:20:57.130 --> 00:21:00.870
Those flames look a lot
weaker than Sister Efil's!

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:03.240
Here we go, one more time!

00:21:03.810 --> 00:21:05.950
Generate Edge!

00:21:12.970 --> 00:21:17.650
A single kid wiped out the
Mixed Demon Beast Army...

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:21.870
Wiped out Trycen's army?

00:21:25.210 --> 00:21:27.870
Sister Mel, I did it!

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:30.520
Great work!

00:21:30.520 --> 00:21:32.230
You did a great job.

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:36.230
Brother Kel will be happy, too, right?

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:40.010
Rion won, didn't she?

00:21:40.010 --> 00:21:44.290
Yeah, she's become really
strong in such a short time.

00:21:44.460 --> 00:21:44.980
Efil!

00:21:50.380 --> 00:21:54.420
Oh? I thought I had you.

00:21:54.770 --> 00:21:56.800
But you aren't dead, are you?

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:02.100
Master...

00:22:04.110 --> 00:22:05.920
He's...

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:09.970
Episode 11: Rank S Promotion Exam

00:22:07.890 --> 00:22:09.130
strong!
